OL,3,GNEWSASwim group a 'reset button' on
OL,4,Amen's mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of a men's sea swimming group
OL,7,Fsay the activity encourages them to
OL,8,Fopen up and helps their mental health.
OL,10,FTrunks and Hunks has grown to hundreds
OL,11,Fof members after Joe Wills started the
OL,12,Fgroup in Eastbourne in 2025.
OL,14,F"Men are very standoffish and we keep
OL,15,Four cards close to our chest," he told
OL,16,Fthe BBC.
OL,18,F"But we found that when we went in the
OL,19,Fsea, we did something together that
OL,20,Fbrought us closer together."
